/-!
# The cone over `Proj` compared with the vector bundle of `𝒪_P(1)`

Let `A = ⨁_{n ≥ 0} 𝒜 n` be a graded ring, `P = Proj A`, `B = ⨁_{d ≥ 0} A_{≥ d}` its truncation
algebra and `π : L = Proj B ⟶ P` the cone of [Stacks, Tag 0EKF]. The degree-one inclusion
`𝒪_P(1) ⟶ π_* 𝒪_L` (`Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjConeTwist.coneTwistHom`) classifies, by the
universal property of the vector bundle `𝐕(𝒪_P(1)) = Spec_P(Sym(𝒪_P(1)))`, a morphism

  `L ⟶ 𝐕(𝒪_P(1))`

over `P`. This file computes it over the standard opens `D₊(cb)` of `P` with `c` homogeneous of
degree `m + 1` and `b` homogeneous of degree `m`, which cover the open of [Stacks, Tag 01MU] for
`d = 1`: there `Γ(D₊(cb), 𝒪_P(1))` is free of rank one, and the comparison on sections is the
identification of the chart of the cone with a polynomial ring in one variable
(`Stacks.Truncation.RatioChart.bijective_polyHom`). Hence the comparison restricts to an
isomorphism over each such `D₊(cb)`. It also carries the zero section of the cone to the zero
section of the vector bundle, over all of `P`, because the zero section is the vertex of the
cone.

## Main definitions

* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjAndSpecInvertibleLocus.twistOne`: the twisting sheaf `𝒪_P(1)`.
* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjAndSpecInvertibleLocus.coneToVectorBundle`: **the morphism
  `L ⟶ 𝐕(𝒪_P(1))` over `P` classified by the degree-one inclusion**.

## Main results

* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjAndSpecInvertibleLocus.isIso_morphismRestrict_basicOpen_mul`:
  the comparison is an isomorphism over `D₊(cb)` when `deg c = deg b + 1`.
* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjAndSpecInvertibleLocus.zeroSection_comp_coneToVectorBundle`:
  **the comparison carries the zero section of the cone to the zero section of the vector
  bundle.**
* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjAndSpecInvertibleLocus.ker_zeroSection_appLE_basicOpen_mul`:
  over `D₊(cb)` the ideal of the zero section of the cone is generated by a nonzerodivisor.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 0EKF](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0EKF)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 01MU](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01MU)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 01M2](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01M2)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

